        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二、中国新闻史</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #444;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    height: 39px;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 3px 0 0;\n    color: #e00000;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 35px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  table {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 681px;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border: 1px solid #858585;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 19px;\n  }\n\n  col.level-one {\n    width: 70px;\n  }\n\n  col.level-two {\n    width: 169px;\n  }\n\n  col.level-three {\n    width: 180px;\n  }\n\n  col.note {\n    width: 121px;\n  }\n\n  th {\n    height: 28px;\n    padding: 0;\n    border-right: 1px solid #8c8c8c;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #777;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 27px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  th:last-child,\n  td:last-child {\n    border-right: 0;\n  }\n\n  td {\n    padding: 5px 7px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #8c8c8c;\n    border-bottom: 1px dotted #aaa;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    word-break: break-all;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n  }\n\n  td.period {\n    padding: 6px 7px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  td.remark {\n    padding: 7px 8px;\n    line-height: 19px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  td.dash {\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .section-end td {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #858585;\n  }\n\n  .r71 { height: 55px; }\n  .r72 { height: 35px; }\n  .r73 { height: 30px; }\n  .r74 { height: 32px; }\n  .r75 { height: 31px; }\n  .r76 { height: 34px; }\n\n  .r81 { height: 31px; }\n  .r82 { height: 38px; }\n  .r83 { height: 31px; }\n  .r84 { height: 49px; }\n  .r85 { height: 58px; }\n\n  .r91 { height: 38px; }\n  .r92 { height: 48px; }\n  .r93 { height: 42px; }\n  .r94 { height: 47px; }\n  .r95 { height: 54px; }\n\n  .compact {\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nowrap {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <h1>二、中国新闻史</h1>\n\n  <table aria-label=\"中国新闻史考点表\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col class=\"level-one\">\n      <col class=\"level-two\">\n      <col class=\"level-three\">\n      <col class=\"note\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>一级考点</th>\n        <th>二级考点</th>\n        <th>三级考点</th>\n        <th>备注</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"r71\">\n        <td class=\"period\" rowspan=\"6\">7.十年内<br>战时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n        <td>（1）国统区国民党新闻事<br>业网的形成</td>\n        <td>①中央通讯社《中央日报》<br>②中央广播电台</td>\n        <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"6\">韬奋精神，一直是<br>这一章的考察重点。<br>另外，关于一些外<br>国记者对中国抗日<br>战争时期的贡献也<br>要掌握。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r72\">\n        <td>（2）红色中华通讯社和<br>《红色中华》</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r73\">\n        <td>（3）《申报》的改革</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r74\">\n        <td>（4）邹韬奋的报刊活动</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r75\">\n        <td>（5）斯诺与《西行漫记》</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r76 section-end\">\n        <td>（6）范长江的新闻活动</td>\n        <td>①范长江<br>②“范长江新闻奖”</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"r81\">\n        <td class=\"period\" rowspan=\"5\">8.抗日战<br>争时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n        <td>（1）延安的新闻事业</td>\n        <td>①红色中华通讯社</td>\n        <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"5\">这一章的重中之重<br>是《解放日报》的<br>改革及其意义，这<br>个过程到底解决了<br>哪些问题，有什么<br>启示也是我们需要<br>重点去掌握的东西。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r82\">\n        <td>（2）延安新华广播电台</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r83\">\n        <td>（3）《解放日报》的改革</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r84\">\n        <td>（4）《新华日报》的创办<br>及其斗争</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r85 section-end\">\n        <td>（5）上海“孤岛”时期新<br>闻界的抗争</td>\n        <td class=\"compact\">①上海“孤岛”时期<br>②“苏联呼声”广播电台<br>③史沫特莱<br>④安娜·路易斯·斯特朗</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr class=\"r91\">\n        <td class=\"period\" rowspan=\"5\">9.解放战<br>争时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n        <td>（1）“拒检运动”</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"5\">解放战争时期的新<br>闻事业重点掌握毛<br>泽东和刘少奇的两<br>个重要讲话以及反<br>客里空运动的内容、<br>意义及启示。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r92\">\n        <td>（2）国民党新闻统制的强<br>化</td>\n        <td>①“第三条道路”<br>②《观察》周刊</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r93\">\n        <td>（3）解放区反“客里空”<br>运动</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r94\">\n        <td>（4）延安新华广播电台解<br>放战争中转移和宣传工作</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r95 section-end\">\n        <td>（5）毛泽东、刘少奇关于<br>新闻工作的重要讲话</td>\n        <td class=\"compact\">①《对晋绥日报编辑人员的谈话》<br>②《对华北记者团的谈话》</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
